# works/stollen.work
# On the shelf from the first Sunday of Advent to Christmas Eve. `on:` is the shelf run
# and gives {days-until} before it; `when: advent` names the window in krume.time it fits.
# Both have to agree for the stollen to be in season.

id:    stollen
title: Butter stollen
kind:  stollen
when:  advent
on:    11-27..12-24
price: 1 kg · €24
facts:
  Butter from Brandenburg, matured for three weeks.
